OL,3,GNEWSALobby calls for end to IVF
OL,4,A'postcode lottery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman from West Sussex is leading a
OL,7,Flobby outside parliament calling for
OL,8,Fthe end of what she describes as a
OL,9,Fpostcode lottery for NHS-funded
OL,10,Ffertility treatment.
OL,12,FKatie Rollings, from Billingshurst, is
OL,13,Fthe founder of the campaign group
OL,14,FFertility Action, which has just helped
OL,15,Frelease a report saying women in some
OL,16,Fareas struggle to get NHS treatment.
OL,18,FRollings spent more than #25,000 on two
OL,19,Frounds of IVF privately to conceive her
OL,20,Ftwins.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
